Ned_Interview_2f06e8f1	t	Alright, let's get this done quickly. We've got some lovely dusk light.	game/tl/deutsch/scene/News/beach/ned_interview.rpy	7	t neutral "[what]"
Ned_Interview_11552c2a	t	So, Ned, you are also a part of the wrestling team, is that correct?	game/tl/deutsch/scene/News/beach/ned_interview.rpy	13	t friendly "[what]"
Ned_Interview_cb8e38ee		Ned looks over to you suspiciously, but when he realized you were holding the camera, his gaze switched quickly back to Tom.	game/tl/deutsch/scene/News/beach/ned_interview.rpy	19	"[what]"
Ned_Interview_cd4a55be	n	Yes, I am part of the wrestling team.	game/tl/deutsch/scene/News/beach/ned_interview.rpy	25	n suspicious "[what]"
Ned_Interview_59bff785	n	Even though I am not really the sporty type.	game/tl/deutsch/scene/News/beach/ned_interview.rpy	31	n sad "[what]"
Ned_Interview_eb404e54	n	But I thought it would look good on my resume.	game/tl/deutsch/scene/News/beach/ned_interview.rpy	37	n tough "[what]"
Ned_Interview_bee88087	t	So... did you win?	game/tl/deutsch/scene/News/beach/ned_interview.rpy	43	t flirt "[what]"
Ned_Interview_c495d78a	n	No, not really. I lost against [name].	game/tl/deutsch/scene/News/beach/ned_interview.rpy	49	n neutral "[what]"
Ned_Interview_a62105d1	n	But I wouldn't have stand a chance against Vincent either.	game/tl/deutsch/scene/News/beach/ned_interview.rpy	55	n "[what]"
Ned_Interview_4fcb4608	n	Well, at least I kicked [name]'s ass.	game/tl/deutsch/scene/News/beach/ned_interview.rpy	61	n happy "[what]"
Ned_Interview_679afe50	n	But I did not have a chance against Vincent.	game/tl/deutsch/scene/News/beach/ned_interview.rpy	67	n neutral "[what]"
Ned_Interview_63f13863	t	Vincent is kind of a celebrity at the university, is he not?	game/tl/deutsch/scene/News/beach/ned_interview.rpy	73	t "[what]"
Ned_Interview_34318c62		Ned grimaced at the mention on Vincent's name.	game/tl/deutsch/scene/News/beach/ned_interview.rpy	79	"[what]"
Ned_Interview_9830d9dc	n	He is a bully, that's what he is!	game/tl/deutsch/scene/News/beach/ned_interview.rpy	85	n angry "[what]"
Ned_Interview_33d0d31c	t	But he is the one who has been tied up in the gym, is he not?	game/tl/deutsch/scene/News/beach/ned_interview.rpy	91	t suspicious "[what]"
Ned_Interview_8e10368a	n	Yes, indeed.	game/tl/deutsch/scene/News/beach/ned_interview.rpy	97	n evil "[what]"
Ned_Interview_8e846c2b	n	And he deserved it.	game/tl/deutsch/scene/News/beach/ned_interview.rpy	103	n "[what]"
Ned_Interview_fee5e0cc	n	Even though I think he enjoyed it.	game/tl/deutsch/scene/News/beach/ned_interview.rpy	109	n neutral "[what]"
Ned_Interview_06f24b8c	t	Has he been forced into this?	game/tl/deutsch/scene/News/beach/ned_interview.rpy	115	t neutral "[what]"
Ned_Interview_9b3b516b	n	No, of course not.	game/tl/deutsch/scene/News/beach/ned_interview.rpy	121	n "[what]"
Ned_Interview_85c443a5	n	I wouldn't be surprised it was his idea in the first place.	game/tl/deutsch/scene/News/beach/ned_interview.rpy	127	n "[what]"
Ned_Interview_9868d9f3	t	Really? Why that?	game/tl/deutsch/scene/News/beach/ned_interview.rpy	133	t surprised "[what]"
Ned_Interview_b17522cd	n	He is a bully, but I have always felt this is just a show.	game/tl/deutsch/scene/News/beach/ned_interview.rpy	139	n suspicious "[what]"
Ned_Interview_5f4699df	t	Okay. Why do you think that?	game/tl/deutsch/scene/News/beach/ned_interview.rpy	145	t suspicious "[what]"
Ned_Interview_60348b26		Ned crossed his arms; you can tell he wouldn't speculate any further.	game/tl/deutsch/scene/News/beach/ned_interview.rpy	151	"[what]"
