News_Intro_Julian_4258a8d3_1	c	Really?	game/tl/deutsch/scene/News/news_intro_julian.rpy	1050	c surprised "[what]"
News_Intro_Julian_0215c691	j	Yeah. He somehow managed to convince the Administrator.	game/tl/deutsch/scene/News/news_intro_julian.rpy	1056	j happy "[what]"
